FILE: cleanse.py
PURPOSE: Detects dirty rows (nulls, type mismatches, null-like strings) and LLM-repairs them in batches.
IMPORTS: os, json, pandas, session, llm, dto_models

CONSTANTS:
  MAX_DIRTY_BATCH = 50
  _NULL_LIKE_STRINGS  frozenset of strings treated as null ("n/a", "null", "?", etc.)

FUNCTIONS:
  _identify_dirty_rows(df) -> pd.Index
    Returns index of rows with: null values OR null-like strings OR type mismatches (numeric col with string values).

  cleanse_data(session) -> SearchResult
    Loads DataFrame from session, identifies dirty rows, sends batches to LLM for repair instructions,
    applies fixes, overwrites file, reloads into DuckDB.
